M09_KeyCard_Zone save/load robustness. The GameObject *mobius member is not
saved and Created() is not re-run on a savegame load, so Custom(COUNT) could
pass an indeterminate pointer to Join_Conversation after a mid-mission load.
Re-fetch it from Find_Object(2000010), the id it is always assigned from;
behaviour is identical while the stored pointer is valid.

--- a/Mission09.cpp
+++ b/Mission09.cpp
@@ -4414,6 +4414,10 @@
 						
 		if ( type == COUNT ) 
 		{
+			// Vita save/load: mobius is not saved and Created() does not re-run
+			// on load, so refresh it from its fixed id before use.
+			mobius = Commands->Find_Object (2000010);
+
 			if (param == 0)
 			{
 				//initiation = true;
